    "media:imagetext": "TWA\nEMPLOYEES' TIMETABLE • DOMESTIC SCHEDULES\nISSUE DATE MARCH 29, 1974\nWe're telling our customers about our local schedule advantages:\nIn\nNew York\nTWA gives you\na 15 minute\nheadstart\nto Chicago.\n13 times a day.\n7:45 am\n8:45 am\n9:45 am\n10:45 am\n11:45 am\n12:45 pm\n1:45 pm\n2:45 pm\n3:45 pm\n4:45pm\n5:45pm\n6:45pm\n7:45pm\nTWA from LaGuardia\n7.45 am tọ 7:45 pm\nevery business day.\nCall your Travel Agent or TWA at 695-6000.\nTWA gives you\na 15 minute\nheadstart\nto LaGuardia.\n13 times a day.\n6:45 am\n7:45 am\n8:45 am\n9:45 am\n10:45 am\n11:45 am\n12:45 pm\n1:45 pm\n2:45 pm\n3:45 pm\n4:45 pm\n5:45pm\n6:45pm\nTWA from Chicago\n6:45 am to 6:45 pm\nevery business day.\nCall your Travel Agent or TWA at 332-7600.\nIn\nChicago\nEFFECTIVE MAY 1, 1974\n(Except as Noted)\nTWA HAS THE\nONLY NON-STOPS\nTO CALIFORNIA.\nTWA also has the most flights\nto California.\nAnd only TWA gives you\nAmbassador Service,*\nwhich makes our flights\nthe most comfortable around.\nFor reservations, see your\nTravel Agent.\nOr call TWA at 391-3600.\nTWA TO LOSANGELES\n8:35am*\n(Direct flight)\n10:40am\n(1011 direct flight)\n2:45 pm\n(Direct flight)\n6:15pm™\n(1011 non-stop)\nTWA TO SAN FRANCISCO\n9:45am*\n(Non-stop)\n6:15pm*\n(1011 direct flight)\nIn\nPittsburgh\nTW\nTWA FORM T211-3-74 PRINTED IN U.S.A.\nEMPLOYEES' TIMETABLE NO. 74-5\nCancels Employees' Timetable No. 74-4",
